!-   ===========  All objects for service water heating system loops ===========
  Sizing:Plant,
    SWHSys1,                 !- Plant or Condenser Loop Name
    Heating,                 !- Loop Type
    60,                      !- Design Loop Exit Temperature {C}
    5.0;                     !- Loop Design Temperature Difference {deltaC}

